STRICT IMPLEMENTATION RULES

1. Never modify unrelated code.
2. Never refactor working modules unless required.
3. Preserve all backend APIs.
4. Preserve Flowise integration.
5. Preserve WebSocket functionality.
6. Preserve Gemini RAG functionality.
7. Preserve Docker configuration.
8. Fix lint/build errors before finishing.
9. Validate functionality after every phase.
10. Generate:
   - Implementation summary
   - Files changed
   - Verification report
11. Stop after completing only the requested phase.
12. Do not begin the next phase until explicitly approved.